From f63eb87ffd7a09c7e017e9f8996ab547ca01aa66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alexssandro56 <56209544+alexssandro56@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:03:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Don't crash UDFPS enrollment without a header
 scroll view

UdfpsEnrollEnrollingView.setFocusOnDescription() posts a runnable that
calls getHitRect() on sud_header_scroll_view. The enrolling layout used on
onyx has no such view, so the lookup returns null and Settings dies with a
NullPointerException about a second into fingerprint enrollment, which
cancels the enroll. Skip the focus adjustment when the view is absent.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QY97AsgNLyAwQpzrsxC9zt
---
 .../biometrics/fingerprint/UdfpsEnrollEnrollingView.java     | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/com/android/settings/biometrics/fingerprint/UdfpsEnrollEnrollingView.java b/src/com/android/settings/biometrics/fingerprint/UdfpsEnrollEnrollingView.java
index 9e595ac..c51890e 100644
--- a/src/com/android/settings/biometrics/fingerprint/UdfpsEnrollEnrollingView.java
+++ b/src/com/android/settings/biometrics/fingerprint/UdfpsEnrollEnrollingView.java
@@ -196,6 +196,11 @@ public class UdfpsEnrollEnrollingView extends GlifLayout {
     void setFocusOnDescription() {
         final ScrollView headerScrollView = findViewById(R.id.sud_header_scroll_view);
         final TextView descriptionView = getDescriptionTextView();
+        // The header scroll view is missing from some enrolling layouts; without it
+        // there is nothing to scroll the description into view against.
+        if (headerScrollView == null) {
+            return;
+        }
         if (descriptionView != null && !descriptionView.getText().isEmpty()) {
             descriptionView.post(
                     () -> {
